The data is the XML of Gismeteo's open inform service (the one its
browser extension used; the paid API needs a token): now, sunrise and
sunset, three-hour steps for today and tomorrow and seven days in all.
The page: now with every value it has, today and tomorrow in eight
steps each, then the week. The window shows the last forecast from the
cache at once and refreshes in the background every 30 minutes, when it
comes back to the front after a while, and from the button. Icons are
drawn here from Gismeteo's icon codes; no artwork of theirs is used.
"""
